      "title": "Crash / Diagnostic Reports (last 1h)",
      "description": "Counts diagnostic or crash reports created in the last hour. Unexpected crashes can indicate instability or security issues.\n\nAuto\u2011fallback to 0 if metric is missing or has no recent samples.",
